Z||000000||Cooter||02-21-2000||07:45 PM||||I have had my 88GT for a couple of months now and it has done nothing but sit and kill the grass. I couldn't decide to build a 2.8, make a 3.1, buy a 3.1 or what. So today while out junk yarding, I saw a 90something Camaro with a 70,000 mile 3.4 and nice grey seats. Well. tomorrow I will have a nice "new" Fiero motor and interior for the insane price of $475. If anybody hears a very loud noise or sees a bright flash and mushroom cloud coming from the South East U.S., dont worry- it is just Cooter's wife blowing up again over "that money pit in the back yard". ||||reg||1
