Z||000003||kong||02-21-2000||08:56 PM||||Don't feel bad cooter. If looks could kill my little baby would be nothing but a bubbling blob of plastic. My wife won't even get in mine. She had to drive it to work for 2 days while I worked on hers. I'll tell you it was terrible to listen to her when she got home.<BR>      She can drive a clutch but she doesn't like to. She tried to get me to sell it last year, but I think she finally gave up. THANK GOD! Now she just sits quietly and glares at it.<p>[This message has been edited by kong (edited 02-21-2000).]||||reg||1
