Z||000007||wkayl||02-21-2000||11:41 PM||||Lucky, lucky me.<BR>From the 1st time I saw my Fiero, it took 9 months to save, pinch, hide, or whatever you call it before I could pay for it.  The 1st time my wife saw it or even knew I was getting one was when it sat in the front yard all paid for, even the license and insurance.  And I'm still married.  I "let" her drive it to work the next 2 days.  She said "I guess if you were going to get one, at least it's a nice one".  She drives it any chance she can make an excuse to.||||reg||1
